      en: ["Named after Sir Arthur Lewis (1979 Nobel Prize)", "Formerly British infantry barracks", "Opened as a community college in 1985", "Architecture features local volcanic stone", "Located on a historical battlefield site", "Offers commanding views of Castries harbor"],
      es: ["Nombrado en honor a Sir Arthur Lewis (Premio Nobel 1979)", "Antiguos cuarteles de infantería británicos", "Inaugurado como Community College en 1985", "Arquitectura de roca volcánica local", "Ubicado en un campo de batalla histórico", "Ofrece vistas al puerto de Castries"],
